OL,3,GNEWSAPolice force to investigate itself
OL,4,Aover alleged corruption
OL,5,
OL,6,FA police force accused of "serious
OL,7,Fcorruption" has announced it will
OL,8,Finvestigate the allegations locally.
OL,10,FSurrey Police said the Independent
OL,11,FOffice for Police Conduct (IOPC) had
OL,12,Fadvised that its own professional
OL,13,Fstandards department could look into
OL,14,Fthe complaints following a review.
OL,16,FIt comes after Chris Coghlan, the MP
OL,17,Ffor Dorking and Horley, alleged the
OL,18,Fforce tipped off suspects during a
OL,19,Fcriminal misconduct in public office
OL,20,Finvestigation into SEND officers at
OL,21,FSurrey County Council.
OL,23,APub: 10-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
